  "body": "A rare live-work property in one of Auckland’s most sought-after Eastern Bays locations — modern, low-maintenance, and exceptionally flexible.\r\n\r\nThis freehold, three-level standalone building has been refurbished and offers a seamless combination of residential comfort and commercial functionality — ideal for business owners, professionals, families, or investors.\r\n\r\nUpstairs – Low-Maintenance Residential Living\r\n4 bedrooms + study\r\n4 bathrooms, including his & hers ensuite in the master\r\nSpacious open-plan kitchen, dining & living\r\nEasy-care modern finishes throughout\r\nGenerous balconies front and rear\r\nNorth-facing outlook toward Rangitoto\r\nRear outlook over Wai o Taiki Bay\r\nA move-in-ready home designed for minimal ongoing maintenance compared with older housing stock.\r\n\r\nDownstairs – Business / Income / Workspace\r\nModern retail or office space with excellent street exposure\r\nLarge workshop / garage\r\nOff-street parking\r\nFlexible use under Business – Neighbourhood Centre zoning\r\nHighly Regarded School Options\r\nZoned for Glendowie School (Years 1–8)\r\nZoned for Glendowie College (Years 9–13)\r\nClose proximity to Sacred Heart College (Catholic boys’ secondary school – enrolment by application and preference)\r\n\r\nKey Property Highlights\r\nFreehold site approx. 204m²\r\nTotal internal area approx. 350m² plus balconies\r\nRecently refurbished and reclad\r\n100% NBS seismic rating\r\nCorner site with strong street presence\r\n\r\nWho This Property Suits\r\nOwner-occupiers wanting home and work under one roof\r\nHome & income buyers\r\nInvestors seeking a split-risk asset\r\nProfessionals, creatives, and small business owners\r\nFamilies wanting flexibility and strong school options\r\n\r\nOpen to Creative Deal Structures\r\nThis is a private sale — no agencies involved.\r\nWe are open to outside-the-box arrangements, including:\r\nProperty swaps\r\nPartial swaps\r\nOther mutually beneficial structures\r\n\r\nImportant Sale Information\r\nThis property is commercially zoned.\r\nThe sale will be plus GST (if any).\r\nViewings by appointment only.\r\nSerious enquiries welcome.",
